    "endingForgiveness": "After the lantern parks, both leaves stay open and the exit is an ordinary broad walk. The two visibly separate doors prevent dashing through the fleeting plate contact while the portal remains linked. Returned cargo rests visibly on the western catch shelf rather than looping.",
    "designNotes": "Two independently closing H groups are separated by 56px. A single thick H group would stay open around an overlapping knight, so independent leaves are necessary. The exact previously successful 155-frame linked-portal dash skip is saved as a failing regression. A visible one-way shelf above the western floor mouth catches a returned lantern, preventing its former automatic portal bounce from repeatedly pulsing the plate. The original low side-entry route is unchanged."
